      "filename": "1865 Spruner Map Israel or Palestine post 70 AD.jpg",
      "title": "File:1865 Spruner Map Israel or Palestine post 70 AD.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/1865_Spruner_Map_Israel_or_Palestine_post_70_AD.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1865_Spruner_Map_Israel_or_Palestine_post_70_AD.jpg",
      "width": 1353,
